   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Setup**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Pumpin' 4 the Man**: back after 57 archived shows (506 days) [3]\n- **War Pigs**: back after 153 archived shows (1545 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **What a Fool Believes (tease)**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2004-10-12** (recommended): source not stated; 39 songs; 183 min [1]\n- **ween2004-10-12.flac16**: source not stated; 37 songs; 184 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2004-10-12**: taped by unknown; transferred by unknown; source: Sony WM-D3 w/ Core-Sound LCB mics onto Maxell XL II-S [1]\n- **ween2004-10-12.flac16**: taped by unknown; transferred by unknown; source: Sony ECM-907 Stereo Mic> Sony MZR-700 Minidisc? [2]. Also: Uploader received files from a friend who cannot recall recording the show [2]",
